HYP-3456 AP84 MOD-35 FLOOR-COUNT CLOSURE
========================================================================
status=EVIDENCE / floor-count derivation of AP-tail escape clock; not an LRC14 proof
source=HYP-3431 fixed corridors + HYP-3454 endpoint clock + HYP-3452 validation

A. Corridor floor-count formula
  fixed_corridors=[8/49,6/35] and [29/35,41/49]
  high_gap=G_k(m)=[(14k+1)/(588m),(14k+13)/(588m)]
  C1 intersection inequalities:
    (14k+13)/(588m) > 8/49
    (14k+1)/(588m)  < 6/35
  count_per_corridor N(m)=floor((504m-6)/70)-floor((96m-13)/14)
  escapes(m)=2*N(m)

